sequenceDiagram
  participant OS as Windows
  participant Win as WindowImpl
  participant In as InputDispatcher
  participant Sig as Signal
  participant Host as WidgetHost
  participant Comp as Compositor
  participant GPU as GPU
  OS->>Win: WM_MOUSEMOVE
  Win->>In: HandlePointer
  In->>Sig: slider writes its bound signal
  Sig->>Host: observers mark elements or render objects dirty
  Host->>Win: RequestFrame
  Note over OS,Win: run loop waits<br/>for the frame waitable
  Win->>Win: RunFrameCallback
  Win->>Host: Update
  Host->>Host: Build dirty elements
  Host->>Host: FlushLayout
  Host->>Host: FlushPaint into layers
  Win->>Comp: Render
  Comp->>GPU: live prepass, then redraw damaged rects
  Comp->>GPU: Present1 with dirty rects
